<title>USA: Old America to open no net new stores in 97.</title>
<headline>Old America to open no net new stores in 97.</headline>
<dateline>HOWE, Texas 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Old America Stores Inc said Wednesday it plans to open no net new stores and to reduce inventory investment per store in 1997.</p>
<p>This is expected to improve cash flow and allow Old America to reduce bank and trade indebtedness, the company said.</p>
</text>
